{"id":"31a1cb59fb59977d","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-representability-theorem.md","title":"Representability Theorem","display":"df-representability-theorem — Representability Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-representability-theorem","aliases":["90-df-representability-theorem"],"display":"df-representability-theorem — Representability Theorem","depends_on":["[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-formula]]","[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]","[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-machine-coding]]","[[90-lem-program-numbering]]","[[90-lem-q-finite-comparison]]","[[90-df-partial-function]]","[[90-df-syntax-interface]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-representability-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-representability-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representability-theorem — Representability Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"42029390ebbb59c5\" href=\"?note=42029390ebbb59c5\" title=\"90-lem-program-numbering\">90-lem-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"25356da0f2b0b22e\" href=\"?note=25356da0f2b0b22e\" title=\"90-lem-q-finite-comparison\">90-lem-q-finite-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，逻辑规则与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"b7d96c072a4c677f\" href=\"?note=b7d96c072a4c677f\" title=\"90-df-predicate-logic\">90-df-predicate-logic</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Represents}\">\\(\\mathrm{Represents}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"137d75d038de4a47\" href=\"?note=137d75d038de4a47\" title=\"90-df-recursive-function-class\">90-df-recursive-function-class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"c61fe71286984490\" href=\"?note=c61fe71286984490\" title=\"90-df-isigma-hierarchy\">90-df-isigma-hierarchy</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}\\)</span> 直接取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"e860bc8bff2a4e39\" href=\"?note=e860bc8bff2a4e39\" title=\"90-df-partial-function\">90-df-partial-function</a> 的数值图定义；函数的输入元组与输出在该关系中按顺序平铺。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^k\">\\(\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^k\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec v)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\setminus\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\">\\(z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\setminus\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}\\)</span>。变量与同时代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"61d70aa13427c3b5\" href=\"?note=61d70aa13427c3b5\" title=\"90-df-syntax-interface\">90-df-syntax-interface</a>，公式列接口见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"4ce2b2789d377e1f\" href=\"?note=4ce2b2789d377e1f\" title=\"90-df-formula\">90-df-formula</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v,z]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v,z]\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v{}^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v{}^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle]\\)</span> 的缩写。图关系的表示实例使用有序变量列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v{}^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle\">\\(\\vec v{}^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系的表示实例使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v\">\\(\\vec v\\)</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> 时前者仅含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，后者为空列。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v,z]\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(f),\\theta),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\\ \\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\vec v]\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_Q(P,\\rho),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\vec v,z]\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\forall z\\bigl(\\theta[\\overline{\\vec n}/\\vec v]\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{f(\\vec n)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v,z]\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(f),\\theta),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\\ \\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\vec v]\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_Q(P,\\rho),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\vec v,z]\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\forall z\\bigl(\\theta[\\overline{\\vec n}/\\vec v]\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{f(\\vec n)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>取计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的固定有限机器。有限计算可以用算术中的余数编码表示：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta(b,c,i,a)\\;:=\\;a&lt;1+(i+1)c\\ \\land\\\n\\exists q\\le b\\ [b=q(1+(i+1)c)+a].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta(b,c,i,a)\\;:=\\;a&lt;1+(i+1)c\\ \\land\\\n\\exists q\\le b\\ [b=q(1+(i+1)c)+a].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,+,\\times,&lt;,\\le\">\\(1,+,\\times,&lt;,\\le\\)</span> 是所定对象语言的数码、运算及缩写。对任意有限数列，可先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 为足够大且被有关小整数整除的数，再由中国剩余定理选择 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>，使各余数依次等于给定列的值。机器固定后，状态、头位置及有限纸带矩阵均可分别用这些余数编码；每一转移用有限转移表的析取式检查，时间、访问位置及所有编码分量都有由整体见证给出的数值界。因此得到有界算术公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_f(\\vec v,w,z)\">\\(A_f(\\vec v,w,z)\\)</span>，表示“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 编码该机器的终止轨迹且输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>”，并把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\le w\">\\(z\\le w\\)</span> 放入该公式。每个真实终止轨迹都有这样的标准见证。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_f(\\vec v,w):=\\exists z\\le w\\ A_f(\\vec v,w,z)\">\\(B_f(\\vec v,w):=\\exists z\\le w\\ A_f(\\vec v,w,z)\\)</span>，并取</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta_f(\\vec v,z):=\\exists w\\bigl(A_f(\\vec v,w,z)\\land\\forall t&lt;w\\ \\neg B_f(\\vec v,t)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta_f(\\vec v,z):=\\exists w\\bigl(A_f(\\vec v,w,z)\\land\\forall t&lt;w\\ \\neg B_f(\\vec v,t)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其矩阵有界，故为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 公式。固定标准输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec n\">\\(\\vec n\\)</span>，选最小真实见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0\">\\(w_0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 能验证每个涉及具体数码的有限运算，证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0\">\\(w_0\\)</span> 成功且所有更小代码失败。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 还可将任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 与固定数码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{w_0}\">\\(\\overline{w_0}\\)</span> 分为有限小值及较大值；较大值被最小性条件排除。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_0\">\\(w_0\\)</span>，有界的输出检验排除所有不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec n)\">\\(f(\\vec n)\\)</span> 的输出。得到第三行的逐输入唯一值结论。有限界的比较在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"25356da0f2b0b22e\" href=\"?note=25356da0f2b0b22e\" title=\"90-lem-q-finite-comparison\">90-lem-q-finite-comparison</a> 中单列。</p>\n<p>对递归关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 取全递归特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_P\">\\(\\chi_P\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho(\\vec v):=\\theta_{\\chi_P}(\\vec v,\\overline1)\">\\(\\rho(\\vec v):=\\theta_{\\chi_P}(\\vec v,\\overline1)\\)</span>。逐输入唯一值式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash0\\ne1\">\\(Q\\vdash0\\ne1\\)</span> 同时给出真例和假例的有限证明。将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 证明包含到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>，即得第一行。此构造只需固定机器的有限转移表，不要求对象理论统一证明机器对所有输入终止。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一行保留原来的表示定理；后两行明确后续证明谓词与 Rosser 构造所需的见证性质。最后一行是对每个标准输入分别存在有限证明，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash\\forall\\vec v\\exists!z\\theta\">\\(Q\\vdash\\forall\\vec v\\exists!z\\theta\\)</span>，所以不能把它误当成本书较强的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}\\)</span>。公式可通过自反等式补足指定自由变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-recursive-function-class","status":"resolved","id":"137d75d038de4a47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-recursive-function-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-isigma-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"c61fe71286984490","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-predicate-logic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d96c072a4c677f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-predicate-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-machine-coding","status":"resolved","id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-8","targetA