f-isigma-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-16","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{RecPred}_k$、$\\mathrm{Represents}$ 及 $\\Sigma_1$ 分别见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]、[[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-isigma-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"c61fe71286984490","anchor":"ref-17","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{RecPred}_k$、$\\mathrm{Represents}$ 及 $\\Sigma_1$ 分别见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]、[[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Graph}$ 直接取 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的数值图定义；函数的输入元组与输出在该关系中按顺序平铺。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-syntax-interface","status":"resolved","id":"61d70aa13427c3b5","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^k$ 且 $\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec v)$；$z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\setminus\\{v_i:i<k\\}$。变量与同时代入见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，公式列接口见 [[90-df-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"4ce2b2789d377e1f","anchor":"ref-20","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^k$ 且 $\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec v)$；$z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\setminus\\{v_i:i<k\\}$。变量与同时代入见 [[90-df-syntax-interface]]，公式列接口见 [[90-df-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-q-finite-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"25356da0f2b0b22e","anchor":"ref-21","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Proof]","excerpt":"其矩阵有界，故为 $\\Sigma_1$ 公式。固定标准输入 $\\vec n$，选最小真实见证 $w_0$。$Q$ 能验证每个涉及具体数码的有限运算，证明 $w_0$ 成功且所有更小代码失败。$Q$ 还可将任意 $w$ 与固定数码 $\\overline{w_0}$ 分为有限小值及较大值；较大值被最小性条件排除。对固定 $w_0$，有界的输出检验排除所有不等于 $f(\\vec n)$ 的输出。得到第三行的逐输入唯一值结论。有限界的比较在 [[90-lem-q-finite-comparison]] 中单列。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\supseteq S_{\\mathrm{arith}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}_k,\\mathrm{RecPred}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Represents}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Graph}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Distinct}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(\\vec v)","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\setminus\\{v_i:i<k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v,z]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v{}^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle]","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec v{}^\\frown\\langle z\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec v","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S[\\vec v,z]\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_T(\\operatorname{Graph}(f),\\theta),\\\\\n&\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{RecPred}_k\\ \\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\vec v]\\\n\\mathrm{Represents}_Q(P,\\rho),\\\\\n&\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Rec}_k\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\Sigma_1\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{arith}}}[\\vec v,z]\\\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\quad\nQ\\vdash\\forall z\\bigl(\\theta[\\overline{\\vec n}/\\vec v]\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{f(\\vec n)}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta(b,c,i,a)\\;:=\\;a<1+(i+1)c\\ \\land\\\n\\exists q\\le b\\ [b=q(1+(i+1)c)+a].","display":true},{"tex":"1,+,\\times,<,\\le","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"A_f(\\vec v,w,z)","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"z\\le w","display":false},{"tex":"B_f(\\vec v,w):=\\exists z\\le w\\ A_f(\\vec v,w,z)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta_f(\\vec v,z):=\\exists w\\bigl(A_f(\\vec v,w,z)\\land\\forall t<w\\ \\neg B_f(\\vec v,t)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec n","display":false},{"tex":"w_0","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"w_0","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{w_0}","display":false},{"tex":"w_0","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec n)","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho(\\vec v):=\\theta_{\\chi_P}(\\vec v,\\overline1)","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\vdash0\\ne1","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\vdash\\forall\\vec v\\exists!z\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongRep}","display":false}],"bytes":4605,"backlinks":[{"id":"7eb380164954dfb8","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-representability-theorem]] — 哥德尔系统的核心定理"},{"id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Represents}_Q$、$Q$、$\\Sigma_1$、$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 分别见 [[90-df-representation]]、[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]、[[90-df-isigma-hierarchy]]、[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]。表示公式存在性见 [[90-df-representability-theorem]]。$p,n,s,i\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"235a1528abe157b8","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"原始递归函数全递归，对其图应用 [[90-df-representability-theorem]]，再合取 $x=x\\land y=y\\land z=z$ 使三个指定自由变量都出现。自反等式不改变逐数正负实例的可证性。"},{"id":"c8a8e90864ab15ce","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}$ 见 [[90-df-syntactic-incompleteness-formal]]；它是递归的全函数，故 [[90-df-representability-theorem]] 提供算术公式 $\\eta(v,z)$，使对每个标准 $n$ 有 $Q\\vdash\\forall z(\\eta(\\bar n,z)\\leftrightarrow z=\\overline{\\mathrm{Neg}_{S,g}(n)})$。"},{"id":"7232dda6455e1c93","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"若 $X$ 递归，由 [[90-df-representability-theorem]] 取得算术公式，并以 $v=v$ 合取使指定自由变量确实出现。反向给定逐数表示公式 $\\varphi$，输入 $n$ 时交错枚举 $T$ 的有限证明，直到发现结论为 $\\varphi[\\overline n/v]$ 或其否定；前者输出 $1$，后者输出 $0$。有效公理化及证明码的对应使这一枚举有效；表示性保证至少一种证明出现；$\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T$ 与 $\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)$ 保证演算一致，因而不会两种都出现。所得全递归函数正是 $X$ 的特征函数。"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-85","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\n[[90-df-haltseq.md]]\n[[90-df-hbl-conditions.md]]\n[[90-df-henkin-sent